category: Libs
requires: cygwin libssl3 libzstd1
sdesc: "File format designed for highly efficient deltas while maintaining good compression (runtime)"
ldesc: "zchunk is a compressed file format that splits the file into independent
chunks. This allows you to only download changed chunks when downloading a new
version of the file, and also makes zchunk files efficient over rsync."
external-source: zchunk

